he number of threads in the group coordinator's CoordinatorExecutor thread pool, which is used for offloading assignment computation from the main coordinator thread.\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/_intake_backup/2026/02/23/github-api-apache-kafka-pr-21555-opened-92a8cbec.md` - which documents PR #21555 that added this config for KAFKA-20210 under KIP-1263.\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"issues/kafka-20291.md\\\",\\\"_intake_backup/2026/01/20/mail-398ec8420639b46ea628a90c-1bb99969.md\\\",\\\"_intake_backup/2026/01/04/mail-deafa8cbb9672c74162f0364-8e55f8fd.md\\\",\\\"_intake_backup/2026/02/23/github-api-apache-kafka-pr-21555-opened-92a8cbec.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":28.14,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":152042,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":16033,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.056352200000000005,\\\"input_tokens\\\":82,\\\"output_tokens\\\":1800}}\"}","_meta":{"fastmcp":{"wrap_result":true}},"structuredContent":{"result":"{\"answer\":\"Perfect! I found the answer. Based on my search through the context filesystem, the broker/executor config name that controls the number of threads for assignment computation offload in **KIP-1263: Group Coordinator Assignment Batching and Offload** is:\\n\\n**`group.coordinator.background.threads`**\\n\\nThis configuration option controls the number of threads in the group coordinator's CoordinatorExecutor thread pool, which is used for offloading assignment computation from the main coordinator thread.\\n\\n**Source:** `/store/_intake_backup/2026/02/23/github-api-apache-kafka-pr-21555-opened-92a8cbec.md` - which documents PR #21555 that added this config for KAFKA-20210 under KIP-1263.\",\"error\":null,\"files\":[\"issues/kafka-20291.md\",\"_intake_backup/2026/01/20/mail-398ec8420639b46ea628a90c-1bb99969.md\",\"_intake_backup/2026/01/04/mail-deafa8cbb9672c74162f0364-8e55f8fd.md\",\"_intake_backup/2026/02/23/github-api-apache-kafka-pr-21555-opened-92a8cbec.md\"],\"seconds\":28.14,\"truncated\":f